    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "topical stuff doesnt really work for me. if i take like 400mg or 600mg of advil with a big meal, is that basically safe since the omeprazole is already doing its job? i really just need to get through the night without feeling like my head is going to explode from the tooth pain. it's just a few days of meds, it shouldn't be a big deal right?",
